pages = PackedStringArray("*Knight\'s Journal*\nSir Gigglebuns IV, knight of Haven.", "Day 1. Swore my oath at the castle today. The King says a knight\'s first duty is to *listen*: to the people, to the land, to the old stories.", "Day 12. Mira at Mirror Lake says the big fish in the lake is a legend. I say it\'s just shy.", "Day 30. Strange smoke in the north again. Probably nothing. Probably.", "Day 31. Someone in the village has started calling herself a *princess*. I did not know we had one.")
